# ===========================================================================
# PT-PT: O que nunca deve entrar no repositorio.
#
#        A entrada que mais importa e o config.json: o ficheiro versionado e o
#        config.example.json, com valores de exemplo. O config.json real leva a
#        rede interna, caminhos da maquina e o destinatario dos emails, e num
#        repositorio publico isso e informacao a mais.
#
# EN-UK: What must never enter the repository.
#
#        The entry that matters most is config.json: the versioned file is
#        config.example.json, carrying example values. The real config.json
#        holds the internal network, machine paths and the e-mail recipient,
#        and in a public repository that is more than anyone needs.
#
# Created by Redfox using Claude
# ===========================================================================

# --- PT-PT: Bytecode e cache / EN-UK: Bytecode and cache -------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- PT-PT: Ambientes virtuais / EN-UK: Virtual environments ---------------
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- PT-PT: Empacotamento / EN-UK: Packaging -------------------------------
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
*.spec

# --- PT-PT: Configuracao real / EN-UK: Real configuration ------------------
config.json
*.local.json
.env
.env.*

# --- PT-PT: Saidas geradas / EN-UK: Generated output -----------------------
Relatorios/
Reports/
Saida/
Output/
*.eml
*.log
logs/

# --- PT-PT: Modelos de voz descarregados / EN-UK: Downloaded speech models --
models/
*.bin
*.onnx

# --- PT-PT: Sistema operativo e editores / EN-UK: OS and editors -----------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~
